  "body": "The post-merge batch gate failed on `60c0f48bf300fd812559291037b4a35e8d86bac5`.\n\nRun: https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/actions/runs/44977407284\n\nFailing steps:\n```\n  FAIL    39s  app suites: slot_dxf_sketch  failed: tests/slot_dxf_sketch.rs [tests: a_slot_outline_seeds_the_slot_and_cuts_it_to_size]\n```\n\nEach push to main has its own run, so this run gates exactly this commit. If the run of the commit before it is green, this commit broke main. Fix it in the normal order; this issue closes itself on the next green run.\n\n<!-- post-merge-last-sha: bf7e68b14c744322041ca6c44b26fb58b8c2b7ee -->",
